  "body": "A brand-new home in an established coastal neighbourhood is becoming harder to find. This House & Land Package gives you the opportunity to secure a generous 445m² (approx.) freehold section in Stanmore Bay, with a well-designed 150m² (approx.) home offering four bedrooms, two bathrooms, an internal-access garage, and modern open-plan living.\r\n\r\nDesigned for the way families live today, the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area is spacious, practical and filled with natural light. The kitchen features quality Bosch appliances, while large sliding doors open onto a generous timber deck, making it easy to enjoy summer barbecues, family dinners or a quiet morning coffee outside. The master suite includes its own ensuite, while the remaining three bedrooms give you plenty of flexibility for children, guests or working from home. Double glazing and upgraded insulation help keep the home warm, dry and comfortable throughout the year.\r\n\r\nOne of the biggest advantages of this package is the location. Stanmore Bay is a well-established community with beaches, schools, cafés, shops and everyday amenities all close by. With the future Penlink connection expected to improve access to and from the Whangaparaoa Peninsula, you’ll enjoy the convenience of staying connected while living close to the coast.\r\n\r\nPackage Features\r\n• 445m² (approx.) freehold section\r\n• 150m² (approx.) home\r\n• 4 Bedrooms | 2 Bathrooms | Internal-Access Garage\r\n• Spacious open-plan kitchen, dining & living\r\n• Designer kitchen with Bosch appliances\r\n• Master suite with ensuite\r\n• Generous timber deck with seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n• Double glazing & upgraded insulation\r\n• 10-Year Stamford Building Warranty\r\n\r\nWhy Choose a House & Land Package? Secure your section now and build with confidence. The advertised package is based on the proposed home design shown, with flexible layout options and upgrade opportunities available, giving you the freedom to personalise your new home to suit your lifestyle.\r\n\r\nFrom section to dream home – create a home that’s uniquely yours. To receive the information pack, specifications and available upgrade options, get in touch with our team today. Or visit our Showhome at 49 Ara Hill Drive, Orewa, and see the quality for yourself.",
